1
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,319
Xiang Lai,

2
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:48,280
why did that guy save us,

3
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,840
only to keep chasing after us?

4
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,480
Right now, besides me,

5
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:53,280
you can't trust anyone. Got it?

6
00:01:53,519 --> 00:01:55,519
I hear him calling for us nearby.

7
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:57,840
Xiang Lai, if you can hear me,

8
00:01:58,719 --> 00:01:59,799
you don't have to come out.

9
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:01,879
But you must...

10
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:04,519
take Hu Ning to the hospital to see his father.

11
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,879
I want to wait near the hospital for my dad.

12
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,120
When his surgery is over,

13
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:10,159
I want him to see me right away.

14
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,879
All right, then we'll go to the hospital.

15
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,599
What a hassle.

16
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,319
It's the code the client requested.

17
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:35,960
All set.

18
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,599
All right.

19
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,960
Captain, this is Mai Ding.

20
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,599
Hello, Mai Ding.

21
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,960
I'm here to protect you. Don't be afraid.

22
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,199
Captain.

23
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:06,080
Although Zhong An has strict protocols,

24
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,800
I still can't

25
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,400
complete this mission alone.

26
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,919
So I'll need your help.

27
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,120
I see.

28
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:14,159
You're the weapon Shen Yu mentioned.

29
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:18,360
This weapon is

30
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,560
a bit tricky for me.

31
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,759
Mai Ding, let me take you to rest.

32
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:45,520
Has he always been this quiet?

33
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:48,120
He's still just a kid.

34
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,479
His father just passed away,

35
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,199
and his sister sent men to kill him.

36
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,759
Anyone in his shoes

37
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,199
would have a hard time accepting that.

38
00:03:54,919 --> 00:03:55,840
His sister...

39
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:03,479
Sha Lan. Sha Lan, Sha Lan!

40
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,680
Here, this is for you.

41
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,319
Cake.

42
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,919
Bringing me so many treats...

43
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,520
You must want something from me.

44
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:15,080
Right. Come, have a seat.

45
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:19,399
Not really, I just wanted to drop by.

46
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,920
How come I don't see anyone else?

47
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,160
They're all on missions.

48
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:24,439
What missions?

49
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,439
You don't need to know that.

50
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,879
I know you're all looking for Xiang Lai.

51
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,399
Is he in some kind of trouble?

52
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,319
If something happened,

53
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:34,439
you have to tell me.

54
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,480
Anda.

55
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,720
Since when did you care about Xiang Lai?

56
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,800
He's just a security guard

57
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,959
at Plato Hotel.

58
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:41,519
What,

59
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:43,759
is your hotel tracking his attendance now?

60
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:46,519
No, I'm only asking out of concern.

61
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,399
Besides, I was at Plato Hotel all day

62
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,519
and couldn't find him anywhere.

63
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,519
Then some chamber of commerce people

64
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:52,360
came looking for him today too.

65
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:53,879
Did he piss someone off,

66
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,959
and go into hiding?

67
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:56,959
Did Wei Tian go to protect him?

68
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,199
Anda, you've got quite an imagination.

69
00:05:00,199 --> 00:05:02,319
Though you got half of it right.

70
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,079
Which half?

71
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,439
As for Xiang Lai, he really is hiding.

72
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:08,279
As for where, nobody knows.

73
00:05:08,439 --> 00:05:09,399
Wei Tian went to look for him,

74
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,720
but not to protect him.

75
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,720
So he really is mixed up in it!

76
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,560
Tell me, what can I do to help him?

77
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,600
That's easy.

78
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,759
The best way you can help him

79
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,160
is to do nothing at all.

80
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,399
I...

81
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,279
Thanks.

82
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,480
Where is my son? Where is he?

83
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,079
Why didn't you bring him here?

84
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,199
You're lying to me! You lied to me!

85
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,639
Please calm down first.

86
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:44,439
Your son has been found.

87
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,319
He's on his way to the hospital now.

88
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,480
We sent someone to escort him here.

89
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:49,519
You're lying!

90
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,040
I don't believe you anymore!

91
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,839
You already lied to me once! I won't believe it!

92
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,839
Your son really has been found.

93
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,519
Look for yourself.

94
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,240
I've already sent people to meet them.

95
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,399
They'll be here any minute.

96
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:04,519
No! My son doesn't wear hats!

97
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:06,079
That's not my son! You're lying to me!

98
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,759
Take me as your hostage instead.

99
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:17,920
Don't move! Stay back!

100
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,639
Let me.

101
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,600
If before five o'clock

102
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,800
your son hasn't arrived at the hospital,

103
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,240
you can kill me.

104
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,560
Also,

105
00:06:29,959 --> 00:06:31,920
where you're standing right now is very dangerous.

106
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,720
Snipers outside could shoot you at any second.

107
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,959
If I stand in front of you,

108
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,519
their chances of hitting you will drop drastically.

109
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:48,560
If I don't see my child before five,

110
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,800
I'll make sure we perish together!

111
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,879
Wei Tian,

112
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,240
the surgery is finished here,

113
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,600
but the head surgeon

114
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,920
still hasn't seen his son.

115
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:14,079
He's taken Rossi hostage

116
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,439
and demands that before five o'clock,

117
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,720
his child must be brought to the hospital.

118
00:07:20,079 --> 00:07:22,680
There are still three hours until five.

119
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:25,240
Sass, I'll bring him back by five.

120
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,959
Trust me.

121
00:07:25,959 --> 00:07:27,560
I believe you can do it.

122
00:07:28,079 --> 00:07:29,120
But if you can't,

123
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,600
everything at the hospital will be my call.

124
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:38,639
When do you plan to leave?

125
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,519
The plan is 11:00 tonight.

126
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,439
There's dessert too.

127
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,240
Mai Ding said it was saved just for you.

128
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,480
Thank you.

129
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,319
Don't mention it.

130
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,759
I just want to ease the tension,

131
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:54,079
so I like having sweets.

132
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:55,720
Yeah, I've heard that too.

133
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,759
Eating sweets

134
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:59,040
can relieve the tension.

135
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,120
But I can't eat them.

136
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,959
My blood sugar is a bit high.

137
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,560
By the way,

138
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,759
the way you make this,

139
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,720
if you add a bit of caramel,

140
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:11,600
see, it'll taste amazing.

141
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,839
Really?

142
00:08:13,639 --> 00:08:14,399
All right, that's done.

143
00:08:14,399 --> 00:08:15,240
Let me try.

144
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,240
Have a taste.

145
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,399
Okay, thanks.

146
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:32,200
Let's go.

147
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,360
Hurry, get down!

148
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,080
Okay.

149
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,159
Hold on tight!

150
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:16,840
Move!

151
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:36,279
Let's go.

152
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,000
Let's check things out first.

153
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,919
Don't want to get ambushed like last time.

154
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:01,679
Let's go.

155
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,879
Come on, let's go.

156
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,559
Hurry, after them!

157
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,240
Come on, get in.

158
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,600
Xiang Lai, hurry and bring the kid up.

159
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,679
We're running out of time, quick!

160
00:12:05,039 --> 00:12:05,399
Okay.

161
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:16,000
It's almost five. Where's my son?

162
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,320
Where on earth is he?

163
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,519
Don't you dare lie to me again.

164
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,200
Dad!

165
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:22,279
Son!

166
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:24,720
Son! Sweetheart!

167
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,519
Son!

168
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,960
You scared me to death, son.

169
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:33,919
Are you okay?

170
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,759
Thank goodness you're fine. Thank goodness.

171
00:12:37,639 --> 00:12:38,639
Dad!

172
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,120
Good boy.

173
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,039
Dad!

174
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:44,919
It's okay. Dad's right here.

175
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,039
I was so scared.

176
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,200
It's so good to see you.

177
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,279
Dad!

178
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:57,519
Turns out I misunderstood Xiang Lai.

179
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,039
You won this deal.

180
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:01,919
Making a deal...

181
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:05,000
isn't that just people bargaining with one another?

182
00:13:05,919 --> 00:13:08,600
Besides, behind every deal,

183
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,320
there's always someone pulling the strings.

184
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,759
Did you find out anything?

185
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:18,440
I found some info on the mastermind.

186
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,480
It leads back to a...

187
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:22,279
village that vanished from the map.

188
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,320
The locals call it Ghost Village.

189
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,120
I went there once before.

190
00:14:09,080 --> 00:14:11,960
Stay back! It's dangerous.

191
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,879
I have a bomb strapped to me.

192
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,759
Who are you?

193
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:21,320
I'm grateful I could still see you.

194
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,200
Who I am doesn't matter.

195
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,279
What did you come here for?

196
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,440
I heard that a man...

197
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,799
...lived here for a while.

198
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:34,000
He taught you a lot of things, too.

199
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:34,840
Didn't he?

200
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:38,360
Eight years ago, that man came here.

201
00:14:38,639 --> 00:14:41,600
Soon, he became good friends with us.

202
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:45,480
He was a remarkable soldier, a teacher,

203
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:48,559
a philosopher, and an astronomer.

204
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,919
Everyone liked him.

205
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:54,679
We were all moved by his words.

206
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:58,559
But seven years ago, he left.

207
00:15:00,159 --> 00:15:01,679
People are a lot like the land.

208
00:15:03,159 --> 00:15:04,519
As long as you sow the seeds,

209
00:15:05,399 --> 00:15:07,240
the soil will change.

210
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,639
Whether it's a desert, a forest,

211
00:15:10,679 --> 00:15:11,679
or a grassland.

212
00:15:13,039 --> 00:15:16,519
My mission in life is to sow seeds

213
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,279
and transform the land.

214
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,799
You've already done so much for us.

215
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:24,080
Teaching the children here to read and write,

216
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:26,360
and helping the youth here

217
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,279
explore the wonders of high tech.

218
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,600
Why do you still have to leave?

219
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,840
Following the monsoons,

220
00:15:34,639 --> 00:15:37,360
I travel throughout my life,

221
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:40,919
sowing seeds across the world.

222
00:15:41,559 --> 00:15:42,360
Soon,

223
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,080
the harvest season will arrive.

224
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,440
Hades, are you saying that here,

225
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:51,559
you've planted seeds in us, too?

226
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,720
One day, you will understand

227
00:15:56,559 --> 00:15:59,200
why my name is Hades.

228
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,799
When he left seven years ago,

229
00:16:04,799 --> 00:16:07,200
the stadium bombing happened here.

230
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,720
Three days ago, he appeared before me.

231
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,840
This time, he came to issue orders.

232
00:16:13,679 --> 00:16:15,879
He left the evidence on me.

233
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,799
If you were late, you would've missed it.

234
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:21,399
This is the proof.

235
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:24,080
He has come to harvest.

236
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,720
I don't know who you are,

237
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:28,200
but I believe

238
00:16:28,759 --> 00:16:32,039
you can save these youths and children,

239
00:16:32,559 --> 00:16:34,799
and stop Hades.

240
00:16:36,639 --> 00:16:38,120
Time is up.

241
00:16:39,519 --> 00:16:40,639
Leave now.

242
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:45,200
Thank you.

243
00:16:56,679 --> 00:16:57,840
The person you're looking for,

244
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,559
I know he exists.

245
00:17:00,399 --> 00:17:01,720
But right now, for the Chamber of Commerce,

246
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,879
all I can do is stay on guard.

247
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:06,240
I don't want to provoke him.

248
00:17:10,519 --> 00:17:11,759
I won't be someone

249
00:17:12,559 --> 00:17:13,880
who's all talk and no action.

250
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,720
Looks like we're still the same, then.

251
00:17:41,359 --> 00:17:42,119
Come with me.

252
00:17:42,119 --> 00:17:43,640
Who else knows about this safe house?

253
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,599
People from Zhong An,

254
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:46,000
and Zhong An's partners.

255
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:47,359
Does Bito know about it?

256
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,160
In principle, they shouldn't.

257
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,160
But I'm not sure

258
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,960
if other joint projects have ever used it.

259
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,200
No way, we can't go there.

260
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,279
Move! Get in the car.

261
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,200
If we don't go,

262
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,400
are we supposed to drag Mai Ding along

263
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,000
as moving targets on the street?

264
00:17:58,200 --> 00:17:59,119
Mai Ding, come with me.

265
00:18:26,839 --> 00:18:27,640
Please follow me.

266
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:29,400
Move, hurry, keep up!

267
00:19:09,039 --> 00:19:09,839
Where's the case?

268
00:19:10,799 --> 00:19:11,599
Over there.

269
00:19:40,119 --> 00:19:42,079
Just one gun? Where's yours?

270
00:19:42,519 --> 00:19:44,240
I don't need one. I am the weapon.

271
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:48,640
Get down!

272
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,440
Get up.

273
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,880
Nice shot. Let's move.

274
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,480
No, he needs to stay hidden.

275
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,839
The drone will be back soon.

276
00:20:04,839 --> 00:20:06,319
It won't. She only has one.

277
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,400
You recognize that drone?

278
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,960
It was my sister's birthday gift.

279
00:20:10,039 --> 00:20:12,000
What about those two women at the hotel?

280
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:12,599
Do you know them, too?

281
00:20:12,599 --> 00:20:13,279
I don't know them.

282
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:15,000
But I know they work for my sister too.

283
00:20:18,079 --> 00:20:18,880
Take cover!

284
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,079
Mai Ding, get inside!

285
00:20:27,079 --> 00:20:27,880
Listen to me.

286
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,079
No matter what you hear,

287
00:20:29,079 --> 00:20:30,279
or what you see, don't come out.

288
00:20:30,279 --> 00:20:31,039
Got it.

289
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:48,000
Come on.

290
00:21:51,880 --> 00:21:53,200
It's not safe here. Let's go.

291
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,000
Okay, let's move.

292
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:15,400
Stop fighting! She won't hurt me.

293
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,119
Stop fighting, she won't hurt me.

294
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,119
Little Prince.

295
00:23:27,519 --> 00:23:28,640
Sorry, it was a misunderstanding.

296
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:29,400
It's fine.

297
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,200
Why were you following us?

298
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,319
It was Mai Ding's mother.

299
00:23:32,599 --> 00:23:35,319
After Maila's assassination attempt was exposed,

300
00:23:35,319 --> 00:23:36,839
the two siblings

301
00:23:36,839 --> 00:23:38,960
are being watched by the tribe again.

302
00:23:39,519 --> 00:23:41,559
I asked Madam's permission to come pick him up.

303
00:23:41,559 --> 00:23:43,119
Thank you for protecting him along the way.

304
00:23:45,559 --> 00:23:46,359
Captain.

305
00:23:46,519 --> 00:23:48,640
Looks like our mission is accomplished.

306
00:23:49,279 --> 00:23:51,759
Yeah. Let's say goodbye here, then.

307
00:23:54,599 --> 00:23:56,480
You still haven't told me your name.

308
00:23:57,839 --> 00:23:58,799
Silent Protectors.

309
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:02,119
Take care.

310
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:07,319
Captain.

311
00:24:07,559 --> 00:24:09,599
I really must thank you on behalf of Zhong An.

312
00:24:09,839 --> 00:24:11,720
Guess it's time to say goodbye again.

313
00:24:11,759 --> 00:24:12,640
On the move again?

314
00:24:14,039 --> 00:24:15,119
Though it's exhausting,

315
00:24:15,319 --> 00:24:16,319
right now,

316
00:24:16,319 --> 00:24:18,319
I really love this feeling of freedom.

317
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:22,160
All right, take care then.

318
00:24:22,799 --> 00:24:23,240
Take care.

319
00:24:32,559 --> 00:24:33,400
Reporting, Mr. Xiang.

320
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,559
Here is the damage report from the operation:

321
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:38,279
Communications: three walkie-talkies damaged,

322
00:24:38,319 --> 00:24:39,680
two headsets lost.

323
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:41,759
Melee weapons: three batons lost,

324
00:24:42,119 --> 00:24:43,519
two daggers lost.

325
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,880
Zero casualties.

326
00:24:46,039 --> 00:24:47,000
Mr. Xiang is calling.

327
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,119
He has important instructions.

328
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:52,720
Dismissed.

329
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:59,359
Xiang Lai from Zhong An Africa Branch reporting.

330
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:00,799
So you still remember to report?

331
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:02,720
Your recent actions

332
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:04,480
show a complete lack of discipline!

333
00:25:04,880 --> 00:25:05,880
So this isn't a report.

334
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:07,720
It's a self-criticism.

335
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,920
The Africa Branch

336
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:14,000
requests a one-week internal training from HQ.

337
00:25:14,200 --> 00:25:16,240
We won't accept new contracts during this time.

338
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:17,359
Request granted.

339
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:19,599
Doesn't it need board approval?

340
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:22,319
The board won't stop me from disciplining my son.

341
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:25,000
Internal training starts tomorrow.

342
00:25:25,519 --> 00:25:27,960
Report daily training progress to HQ,

343
00:25:28,039 --> 00:25:29,759
along with the schedule for the next day.

344
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:32,920
Yes, sir. I'll draft the training plan right away.

345
00:25:52,920 --> 00:25:54,279
You're too slow getting down.

346
00:25:54,279 --> 00:25:56,160
Now, Mr. Xiang will give you a demonstration.

347
00:25:56,559 --> 00:25:58,759
Attention! About face!

348
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:00,759
Parade rest!

349
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,079
Watch closely, everyone.

350
00:26:22,559 --> 00:26:25,200
This is the proper form.

351
00:26:26,160 --> 00:26:27,359
Did everyone catch that?

352
00:26:27,759 --> 00:26:28,720
Loud and clear!

353
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,640
Good. Start training.

354
00:26:33,519 --> 00:26:36,079
I'm holding a dummy bomb.

355
00:26:37,759 --> 00:26:39,480
But if you encounter a real one,

356
00:26:40,039 --> 00:26:41,480
do you know what to do?

357
00:26:46,559 --> 00:26:47,880
When we encounter an explosive,

358
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:51,160
we must first isolate our VIP.

359
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,079
When the VIP cannot be isolated

360
00:26:53,079 --> 00:26:54,240
from the surroundings,

361
00:26:54,599 --> 00:26:56,200
bomb disposal is required.

362
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:57,720
First,

363
00:26:58,160 --> 00:27:00,079
contain the risks and cordon off the area.

364
00:27:00,519 --> 00:27:02,039
Evacuate everyone from the scene.

365
00:27:02,319 --> 00:27:05,200
Then defuse the bomb with available resources.

366
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:07,240
To sum it up,

367
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:08,839
three key steps:

368
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:12,119
First, relocate the VIP.

369
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:16,359
Second, manage risks and clear the area.

370
00:27:17,359 --> 00:27:21,720
Third, adapt to conditions and defuse it.

371
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,039
Does everyone understand?

372
00:27:23,039 --> 00:27:23,759
Understood!

373
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:33,200
Then I'll head out first.

374
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:40,319
Do we have a group booking today?

375
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,119
I... I don't know.

376
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:44,720
Is there a meeting?

377
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:48,119
Right, a meeting! I almost forgot.

378
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:49,519
A meeting.

379
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:51,519
Uh... well...

380
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,920
What's going on here?

381
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,240
Xiao, where's your helicopter?

382
00:28:02,759 --> 00:28:04,880
What helicopter? This is a conference room.

383
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:08,079
Flying home takes a big airliner.

384
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:10,119
Fly home?

385
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,720
Are we having a meeting with headquarters?

386
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:16,039
Quick!

387
00:28:22,759 --> 00:28:23,559
Hello, everyone.

388
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:26,759
Xiao, you've worked hard lately.

389
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,400
After receiving Xiao's report,

390
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:31,519
we held an emergency meeting overnight

391
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:33,440
regarding Plato Hotel's

392
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:35,000
Antilocaris branch,

393
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:37,119
to discuss this recent incident.

394
00:28:37,799 --> 00:28:38,839
The board of directors believes

395
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:41,440
Xiao Chuan kept his composure under pressure,

396
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:43,680
effectively contained the situation,

397
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,720
and protected the hotel's reputation.

398
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:47,759
Therefore, Xiao Chuan is specially awarded

399
00:28:48,519 --> 00:28:50,680
the title of Hotel Security Guardian,

400
00:28:50,920 --> 00:28:53,000
along with a cash bonus.

401
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,440
Th-Thank you for the commendation, headquarters.

402
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,240
Um, Dan...

403
00:28:57,599 --> 00:28:58,720
Well, uh...

404
00:28:58,720 --> 00:29:02,160
I'm still staying on as

405
00:29:02,279 --> 00:29:04,000
the Antilocaris branch's

406
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:04,960
general manager, right?

407
00:29:06,039 --> 00:29:07,160
I almost forgot.

408
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:09,559
Since Xiao

409
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:11,440
is already the branch's general manager,

410
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:13,240
there is no room for promotion.

411
00:29:13,799 --> 00:29:15,519
So the corresponding reward

412
00:29:15,519 --> 00:29:17,400
can only be converted into cash.

413
00:29:18,400 --> 00:29:19,880
Finance will disburse it to you

414
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:21,079
on the tenth of next month.

415
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:22,799
Right. W-Wise decision, boss!

416
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:25,480
Rest assured, Dan.

417
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:26,720
I will definitely lead

418
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,000
all the staff at the branch

419
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,839
to keep up the good work and achieve more!

420
00:29:31,319 --> 00:29:32,279
We have full faith in

421
00:29:32,519 --> 00:29:34,000
Xiao and

422
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,599
the entire branch staff's capabilities.

423
00:29:35,759 --> 00:29:37,000
I'd also like to thank you all

424
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,839
for everything you've done for the company.

425
00:29:39,319 --> 00:29:41,880
All right, that's all for today's meeting.

426
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:44,079
Thank you. Thank you. Goodbye.

427
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:50,079
Xiao, what did you report to headquarters?

428
00:29:50,079 --> 00:29:52,599
Didn't we agree that reports to headquarters

429
00:29:52,599 --> 00:29:54,160
require a collective discussion?

430
00:29:58,119 --> 00:30:01,119
Didn't you hear what Dan just said?

431
00:30:01,599 --> 00:30:03,880
An emergency! It was an emergency!

432
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:06,000
Special situations require special measures.

433
00:30:06,119 --> 00:30:07,119
There was no time,

434
00:30:07,119 --> 00:30:08,759
so I sent it straight up.

435
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:13,039
Right. Wise move, Xiao! Very wise!

436
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,240
Right, right, right.

437
00:30:20,119 --> 00:30:20,920
All right, then.

438
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,759
The meeting is over now.

439
00:30:22,759 --> 00:30:25,400
All right, everyone get back to work.

440
00:30:25,680 --> 00:30:26,240
Meeting adjourned.

441
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:31,400
Let's go.

442
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:56,559
I'm telling you, headquarters is being totally unfair.

443
00:30:56,559 --> 00:30:57,799
Xiao is straight up cheating.

444
00:30:58,160 --> 00:30:59,680
And staying at the hotel every day,

445
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:01,160
I'm constantly on edge.

446
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:02,799
I don't want to stay at the hotel anymore.

447
00:31:02,799 --> 00:31:04,200
Not even for another minute.

448
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:05,440
I really can't take it anymore.

449
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:06,279
I'm coming over to see you right now.

450
00:31:09,079 --> 00:31:09,799
Anda,

451
00:31:10,559 --> 00:31:11,880
you're an adult now.

452
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:14,240
Living here in Antilocaris,

453
00:31:14,319 --> 00:31:16,240
you must learn to adapt to the environment.

454
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,400
Once you move back to the Silent Protectors base,

455
00:31:18,799 --> 00:31:20,160
make sure you keep yourself safe.

456
00:31:21,359 --> 00:31:23,039
I don't want to see anyone close to me

457
00:31:23,359 --> 00:31:24,599
get hurt ever again.

458
00:32:38,119 --> 00:32:39,160
Wei Tian is back.

459
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,480
And he brought Anda back with him.

460
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,119
Why did you bring her back?

461
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,480
Um, you guys must be hungry, right?

462
00:32:45,799 --> 00:32:46,920
I'll go cook. I'll make something.

463
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:48,759
We literally just ate, okay?

464
00:32:50,319 --> 00:32:51,119
Sha Lan.

465
00:32:51,759 --> 00:32:53,079
Anda decided to move back in.

466
00:32:53,079 --> 00:32:53,880
You don't mind, do you?

467
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,039
That concludes the report.

468
00:33:01,559 --> 00:33:02,559
Tomorrow we'll proceed with

469
00:33:02,559 --> 00:33:03,880
the unarmed gun disarming drills.

470
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:04,680
That won't be necessary.

471
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:07,079
Put tomorrow's training on hold.

472
00:33:07,079 --> 00:33:07,799
Understood.

473
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:09,720
Mr. Xiang.

474
00:33:10,039 --> 00:33:11,960
Is our suspension training ending early?

475
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,759
Here's the situation.

476
00:33:13,079 --> 00:33:14,440
The board is considering

477
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:16,720
shutting down Zhong An Group's African branch.

478
00:33:18,319 --> 00:33:20,279
Shutting it down? Why?

479
00:33:21,880 --> 00:33:23,960
Because of the mess you've been making there.

480
00:33:27,559 --> 00:33:29,200
The board conducted a thorough review of

481
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:30,839
the current situation in Antilocaris,

482
00:33:31,079 --> 00:33:33,799
and while there is market demand,

483
00:33:34,079 --> 00:33:34,880
however...

484
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:37,599
Locally, there's the prominent security firm Bito,

485
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:38,759
there are mercenaries,

486
00:33:39,039 --> 00:33:40,759
and there's also a mysterious

487
00:33:40,759 --> 00:33:43,079
yet resourceful team called the Silent Protectors.

488
00:33:43,759 --> 00:33:44,799
When it comes to connections,

489
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:47,720
you can't rival the local firm, Bito.

490
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:49,319
When it comes to tactics,

491
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:51,519
you can't be like mercenaries

492
00:33:51,519 --> 00:33:53,039
who stop at nothing.

493
00:33:53,079 --> 00:33:55,319
In terms of service and reputation,

494
00:33:55,440 --> 00:33:57,839
the locals would rather hire

495
00:33:58,359 --> 00:34:01,519
the agile, adaptable Silent Protectors.

496
00:34:01,799 --> 00:34:03,839
Since you have no edge anywhere,

497
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:07,200
the board is considering cutting its losses early.

498
00:34:07,359 --> 00:34:08,400
Cutting losses early?

499
00:34:09,519 --> 00:34:10,320
Mr. Xiang...

500
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:12,599
Last time, time was running out,

501
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,679
and I acted stubbornly on my own,

502
00:34:14,880 --> 00:34:16,440
causing losses for the group.

503
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:17,960
I take full responsibility.

504
00:34:18,239 --> 00:34:19,079
But Zhong An

505
00:34:19,079 --> 00:34:21,159
has just gained a foothold in Antilocaris.

506
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:22,639
In terms of client base,

507
00:34:22,639 --> 00:34:24,159
we truly can't match Bito.

508
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:25,760
But in terms of capability,

509
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,199
we're no worse than the Silent Protectors.

510
00:34:27,559 --> 00:34:28,360
Mr. Xiang,

511
00:34:28,599 --> 00:34:30,599
getting this foothold in Antilocaris

512
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:32,320
cost enormous manpower and resources.

513
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:33,760
If we pull out now,

514
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:34,880
all of it will have gone to waste.

515
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:37,199
As long as Zhong An

516
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,400
in Antilocaris

517
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,639
can boost our influence,

518
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:41,519
we'll definitely have a bright future.

519
00:34:41,559 --> 00:34:42,719
Boost your influence?

520
00:34:42,719 --> 00:34:43,400
Yes.

521
00:34:43,599 --> 00:34:44,719
I actually have an idea.

522
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,119
Why don't

523
00:34:46,119 --> 00:34:47,920
we stage a competition with the Silent Protectors?

524
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:49,760
In front of the Chinese community in Antilocaris,

525
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:50,840
we can raise our profile.

526
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:51,840
Are you confident you can pull it off?

527
00:34:52,000 --> 00:34:53,159
I'll make sure it's done right.

528
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,800
In Antilocaris...

529
00:34:55,159 --> 00:34:55,840
Mr. Xiang,

530
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:58,000
please put in a good word for us with the board

531
00:34:58,480 --> 00:35:00,079
and help buy us a little more time.

532
00:35:16,039 --> 00:35:16,840
Wei Tian.

533
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:19,679
Have a match with me.

534
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:22,800
In what?

535
00:35:23,679 --> 00:35:24,519
Anything you want.

536
00:35:25,039 --> 00:35:26,639
As long as we determine a winner.

537
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:29,559
Then there's no need to compete.

538
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:31,199
Let's just say I lost and you won.

539
00:35:31,199 --> 00:35:32,000
Happy now?

540
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:34,199
I haven't even said what the contest is,

541
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:35,400
and you've already conceded.

542
00:35:36,519 --> 00:35:37,480
I'm not interested.

543
00:35:42,559 --> 00:35:44,119
Just consider it a favor to me.

544
00:35:45,199 --> 00:35:46,840
This competition involves Zhong An.

545
00:35:52,119 --> 00:35:53,639
If you don't accept my challenge,

546
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:55,679
Zhong An's Africa branch will be shut down.

547
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:01,679
What?

548
00:36:01,679 --> 00:36:02,360
Did our place

549
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:03,760
not leave a deep impression on you?

550
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:04,599
You still dare to come here?

551
00:36:06,519 --> 00:36:07,519
Do you think I'm someone

552
00:36:07,519 --> 00:36:08,519
who gets knocked down so easily?

553
00:36:09,679 --> 00:36:10,719
You're obviously here for something.

554
00:36:10,719 --> 00:36:11,960
Spill it quickly, I'm busy.

555
00:36:14,519 --> 00:36:15,880
You played well in that match earlier.

556
00:36:19,119 --> 00:36:20,400
How did you know I was playing a match?

557
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:22,599
Did you hack our computers?

558
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:24,639
That's impossible.

559
00:36:24,639 --> 00:36:26,320
Our system can't be hacked.

560
00:36:27,320 --> 00:36:28,880
Not only do I know you were playing,

561
00:36:29,079 --> 00:36:30,239
I also know that in the dorm,

562
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:32,119
Rossi is reading a psychology book,

563
00:36:32,599 --> 00:36:33,760
and Uncle Shengli is downloading

564
00:36:33,760 --> 00:36:35,280
Natalie Portman's new movie.

565
00:36:36,719 --> 00:36:38,400
You hacked our surveillance room?

566
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:41,079
There are no cameras in the dorm.

567
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:44,719
Wait, what did you actually do?

568
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:55,719
See for yourself.

569
00:37:02,079 --> 00:37:03,440
This thing is pretty cool.

570
00:37:05,119 --> 00:37:06,280
Where is it?

571
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:10,800
This is our Zhong An Group's

572
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:12,679
newly developed flying camera.

573
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,079
And its design

574
00:37:14,079 --> 00:37:16,079
is custom-made to mimic local insects.

575
00:37:16,079 --> 00:37:16,920
Interesting.

576
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:18,280
How is it? Does it work well?

577
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:19,079
Tell me about it.

578
00:37:20,159 --> 00:37:21,440
Agree to my condition first,

579
00:37:21,639 --> 00:37:22,760
and not only will I tell you,

580
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:24,000
I'll even give it to you for free.

581
00:37:25,119 --> 00:37:25,960
For real?

582
00:37:27,039 --> 00:37:27,840
Let's hear it.

583
00:37:30,440 --> 00:37:31,840
I want to organize

584
00:37:31,840 --> 00:37:33,159
a joint security competition with Wei Tian,

585
00:37:33,679 --> 00:37:35,039
but I need your help.

586
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:38,639
Well...

587
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:47,199
Fine, leave it to me.

588
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,519
Just make sure you clear it with the others.

589
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,480
And don't forget to give this to me.

590
00:37:53,199 --> 00:37:54,039
It's a deal.

591
00:37:59,239 --> 00:38:00,800
Got a new toy to play with.

592
00:38:10,960 --> 00:38:12,960
After what happened at the hotel,

593
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:14,639
we're willing to cooperate in any way.

594
00:38:15,199 --> 00:38:18,360
But the two of you working together

595
00:38:18,360 --> 00:38:19,920
feels a bit unbelievable.

596
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:21,679
What's so unbelievable about that?

597
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,639
We've always gotten along great.

598
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:30,719
Well, if you really do cooperate,

599
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:33,440
all the Chinese in Antilocaris

600
00:38:33,440 --> 00:38:35,079
will be much safer.

601
00:38:36,199 --> 00:38:38,920
Wei Tian, even Anda sees it clearer than you.

602
00:38:40,599 --> 00:38:42,320
So how should we cooperate?

603
00:38:42,760 --> 00:38:43,840
That's simple.

604
00:38:44,400 --> 00:38:46,639
It'll be best two out of three.

605
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:48,599
Each round will have a different scenario.

606
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,239
For the first round,

607
00:38:50,599 --> 00:38:52,679
we Silent Protectors defend, and Zhong An attacks.

608
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:55,199
In round two, Zhong An attacks and Silent Protectors defend.

609
00:38:55,199 --> 00:38:57,000
Same for round three. Any objections?

610
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:00,880
As for the first round,

611
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:03,000
it's to protect the VIP's daily routine.

612
00:39:26,800 --> 00:39:28,880
The VIP is most likely right here.

613
00:39:29,159 --> 00:39:31,199
They could enter from the terrace or the adjacent room.

614
00:39:34,360 --> 00:39:35,199
Any plan you can think of,

615
00:39:35,199 --> 00:39:36,599
the Silent Protectors have definitely thought of too.

616
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:38,400
We're going with Plan B.

617
00:39:53,159 --> 00:39:53,960
It's started.

618
00:39:54,760 --> 00:39:55,920
They're seriously underestimating me.

619
00:40:11,079 --> 00:40:11,599
Hello.

620
00:40:45,679 --> 00:40:46,719
All clear on my end.

621
00:41:17,239 --> 00:41:18,320
Why me?

622
00:41:20,159 --> 00:41:21,199
They have snipers.

623
00:41:21,639 --> 00:41:23,320
They chose you as the VIP, too.

624
00:41:23,880 --> 00:41:26,719
Snipers? Isn't it just a drill?

625
00:41:26,760 --> 00:41:28,519
Yeah, a competition drill.

626
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:30,760
Then what are they going to do to me?

627
00:41:30,760 --> 00:41:31,519
Assassinate you.

628
00:41:31,519 --> 00:41:32,239
What?

629
00:41:32,599 --> 00:41:33,599
Just assassinate you.

630
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,800
The weapons are real.

631
00:41:38,239 --> 00:41:39,519
The ammo is fake.

632
00:41:40,159 --> 00:41:41,000
It's not lethal.

633
00:41:41,519 --> 00:41:43,840
So they're actually going to shoot at me?

634
00:41:45,599 --> 00:41:47,559
Then if it's fake,

635
00:41:48,239 --> 00:41:50,079
I won't get hurt if I get hit, right?

636
00:41:52,719 --> 00:41:53,480
You won't get injured.

637
00:41:53,480 --> 00:41:54,519
But it'll sting a bit.

638
00:41:55,519 --> 00:41:57,880
So there's still a chance of getting hurt!

639
00:41:59,079 --> 00:42:00,119
Your assessment is correct.

640
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,800
You'll protect me, right?

641
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:10,280
They're coming to kill me!

642
00:42:10,559 --> 00:42:12,599
Are you still there? Wei Tian! Wei Tian!

643
00:42:41,039 --> 00:42:42,480
Why are you just standing here,

644
00:42:42,559 --> 00:42:44,079
without doing anything?

645
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:45,320
Aren't you supposed to protect me?

646
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:46,480
Aren't you completely fine?

647
00:42:47,639 --> 00:42:48,480
I'm telling you,

648
00:42:48,719 --> 00:42:50,239
if this happens again,

649
00:42:50,519 --> 00:42:52,840
you must stay within one meter of me.

650
00:42:53,519 --> 00:42:55,199
You may be our VIP,

651
00:42:55,800 --> 00:42:57,199
but on our missions,

652
00:42:57,440 --> 00:42:58,960
we have our own rules.

653
00:42:59,039 --> 00:43:00,920
What kind of VIP is treated like this?

654
00:43:04,199 --> 00:43:04,840
Wait, no, don't!

655
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:16,880
The VIP has moved on to the next event.

656
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:18,760
They already know where our room is.

657
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:21,119
Got it. I know what to do.

658
00:43:21,119 --> 00:43:22,039
Hello, room service.

659
00:43:29,039 --> 00:43:31,440
Hello, here's the fruit platter you ordered.

660
00:43:32,119 --> 00:43:32,920
Thank you.
